      "excerpt": "EIT InnoEnergy, Beeplanet & Zabala - IDAE grants for energy storage and real application cases Skip To Main Content Portfolio Ecosystem For Startups For Investors For Industry For Students Skills Institute About us Oct 14, 2021 EIT InnoEnergy, Beeplanet & Zabala – IDAE grants for energy storage and real application cases EIT InnoEnergy, BeePlanet and Zabala invite you to participate in their webinar on how to benefit from IDAE funds support for storage innovations and how to apply it in industry and the primary sector, with practical cases. Register here! Agenda 30″ // How to benefit from IDAE grants for self-consumption and energy storage. – How to approach and present a project so that it can be financed. Keys to present the proposal. – Practical cases of financing: + Amount of aid in each type of line of financing. Financing. + Analysis of real budgets and final amounts of funding. 10″ // Case studies of storage applications with second-life batteries for electric vehicles: – Case of self-consumption in the primary sector: farms. – Case of industrial self-consumption and support for charging hubs. – Case of storage as support for fast charging points. recharging points. 10″ // Questions BeePlanet will be at the annual EIT InnoEnergy event, The Business Booster, in Berlin. If you would like to meet them and have the opportunity to exchange views with them, do not hesitate to"
