      "id": "check-page-1332f6445a",
      "url": "https://innoenergy.com/news-resources/eit-innoenergy-invests-in-tribonex-to-reduce-friction-losses-and-wear-in-industrial-applications/",
      "page": "application",
      "excerpt": "EIT InnoEnergy invests in Tribonex to reduce friction losses and wear in industrial applications Skip To Main Content Portfolio Ecosystem For Startups For Investors For Industry For Students Skills Institute About us Sep 19, 2023 EIT InnoEnergy invests in Tribonex to reduce friction losses and wear in industrial applications EIT InnoEnergy, the innovation engine for sustainable energy across Europe, has invested in Tribonex, a Swedish scale-up offering surface treatment methods for friction and wear reduction in industrial applications. Estimates suggest that roughly 20% of the global energy use is lost to overcome friction in various applications such as EV drive trains, gearboxes, pumps and compressors. Friction not only results in significant energy losses, but also leads to wear, shortening both maintenance intervals and lifespan of industrial equipment. Additionally, friction generates heat, which often requires cooling systems. Tribonex provides patented, scalable and cost-effective surface treatments to reduce friction and wear – enabling their customers across various industries to cut operational expenses, prolong the lifespan of equipment and reduce failure rates. “We have during several years followed the progress by the Tribonex team and we are highly impressed by the accelerating market traction driven by their recent achievements in improving the technology to be"
    },
    {
      "id": "check-page-238924b349",
      "url": "https://innoenergy.com/news-resources/impact-startups-le-village-by-ca-calls-for-applications-with-innoenergy-france-credit-agricole-cib-makesense-seed-i-groupe-psa/",
      "page": "application",
      "excerpt": "\"Impact Startups\": Le Village by CA calls for applications with InnoEnergy France, Credit Agricole CIB, makesense Seed I & Groupe PSA Skip To Main Content Portfolio Ecosystem For Startups For Investors For Industry For Students Skills Institute About us Jan 20, 2023 “Impact Startups”: Le Village by CA calls for applications with InnoEnergy France, Credit Agricole CIB, makesense Seed I & Groupe PSA Call for applications “Impact Startups”: [Press release] The Village by CA and Credit Agricole CIB , EIT InnoEnergy , makesense Seed I & Groupe PSA are launching a call for applications dedicated to social and environmental startups. Deadline to apply: March 31, 2020 Paris, March 9, 2020 The Village by CA Paris, a unique ecosystem where startups and large groups meet and cooperate to innovate together, launches a call for applications dedicated to social and environmental startups in partnership with Crédit Agricole CIB, EIT InnoEnergy , make s ense Seed I and Groupe PSA. A call dedicated to startups with a positive impact on the environment and society All startups presenting a technology that responds to sustainable development: environmental (circular economy, carbon footprint, preservation of resources, etc.), social (inclusion, disability, education, health, etc.), and societal (mobility, cyber security, etc.) are eligible. A call for applications from 9 March to 31 March 2020"
    },
