      "id": "check-page-55aafa8f42",
      "url": "https://innoenergy.com/news-resources/open-call-for-eit-innoenergy-hub-applications-in-hungary-and-turkey/",
      "page": "application",
      "excerpt": "Open call for EIT InnoEnergy Hub applications in Hungary and Turkey Skip To Main Content Portfolio Ecosystem For Startups For Investors For Industry For Students Skills Institute About us Nov 24, 2020 Open call for EIT InnoEnergy Hub applications in Hungary and Turkey EIT InnoEnergy Hubs are local offices operated by ambitious partners, who are looking to build their local position, strengthen their business model and become a leading actor in the local ecosystem by playing a role in our European Network. We are currently looking for partners to operate EIT InnoEnergy Hubs supported by the EIT InnoEnergy Power Alliance platform in the following countries: Hungary & Turkey. EIT InnoEnergy HUB’s scope Identify, develop, and support promising ideas, startups and entrepreneurs. Provide access to EIT InnoEnergy services Host and promote co-branded events (i.e. PowerUp! Competition, TBB, etc). Perform innovation capacity building services, pre-acceleration programmes. Actively promote EIT InnoEnergy Business Model and participate in the local ecosystem Perform local business development services and support sales channels for EIT InnoEnergy portfolio. How to apply Send the filled application form to apply@innoenergy.com . In case you need assistance at any point of the application process, please feel free to contact us at apply@innoenergy.com . <<<Download application form"
    },
